<span id="Ax6.SSx1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax6.SSx1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Initial Prompt: from template</span></span>
