<section id="Ax19.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Case Study</h3>

<section id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">MSGD Optimizer</h4>

<div id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide a detailed explanation of how the MSGD Optimizer works. Taking the NER task as a case study, based on batch dataset <math id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D=\{(x_{0},y_{0}),(x_{1},y_{1}),...,(x_{m},y_{m})\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D=\{(x_{0},y_{0}),(x_{1},y_{1}),...,(x_{m},y_{m})\}</annotation></semantics></math> , we first evaluate the performance of the initial prompt to establish our starting point.</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="95.56" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 700 95.56" width="700"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,95.56) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 15.81 L 0 79.76 C 0 88.49 7.08 95.56 15.81 95.56 L 684.19 95.56 C 692.92 95.56 700 88.49 700 79.76 L 700 15.81 C 700 7.08 692.92 0 684.19 0 L 15.81 0 C 7.08 0 0 7.08 0 15.81 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 15.81 L 1.97 74.14 L 698.03 74.14 L 698.03 15.81 C 698.03 8.16 691.84 1.97 684.19 1.97 L 15.81 1.97 C 8.16 1.97 1.97 8.16 1.97 15.81 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 80.05)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="571.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:41.27em;">
<span id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Initial Evaluation</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 27.75)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:47.46em;--ltx-fo-height:2.5em;--ltx-fo-depth:1.01em;font-size:10pt;" height="48.55" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 34.58)" width="656.71"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<div id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:47.46em;">
<section id="Ax20" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Meta-prompt Module</h2>

<div id="Ax20.p1" class="ltx_para">
<table id="Ax20.p1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
