<div id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">At the beginning of training, we randomly select a subset of Operators and meta-prompt module for optimization. The selected operators and meta-prompts for the current iteration are as follows. This means we utlize <span id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">rewrite</span> operator to update label <span id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">address</span> section and <span id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p5.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">refine</span> to optimize label <span id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p5.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">book</span>.</p>
</div>
<div id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="84.57" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 700 84.57" width="700"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,84.57) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 15.81 L 0 68.76 C 0 77.49 7.08 84.57 15.81 84.57 L 684.19 84.57 C 692.92 84.57 700 77.49 700 68.76 L 700 15.81 C 700 7.08 692.92 0 684.19 0 L 15.81 0 C 7.08 0 0 7.08 0 15.81 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 15.81 L 1.97 60.46 L 698.03 60.46 L 698.03 15.81 C 698.03 8.16 691.84 1.97 684.19 1.97 L 15.81 1.97 C 8.16 1.97 1.97 8.16 1.97 15.81 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 69.06)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="571.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
