<div id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p9.1" class="ltx_p">Then, we normalize the loss using <math id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Norm" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Norm</annotation></semantics></math>. Assuming <math id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> = 1, we can now calculate the value of <math id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q(s_{i},o_{j})=Q(s_{i-1},o_{j-1})*(1+\alpha Norm)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">∗</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q(s_{i},o_{j})=Q(s_{i-1},o_{j-1})*(1+\alpha Norm)</annotation></semantics></math></p>
</div>
<div id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="Ax19.SSx1.SSSx1.p10.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="99.04" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 700 99.04" width="700"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,99.04) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 15.81 L 0 83.23 C 0 91.96 7.08 99.04 15.81 99.04 L 684.19 99.04 C 692.92 99.04 700 91.96 700 83.23 L 700 15.81 C 700 7.08 692.92 0 684.19 0 L 15.81 0 C 7.08 0 0 7.08 0 15.81 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 15.81 L 1.97 77.62 L 698.03 77.62 L 698.03 15.81 C 698.03 8.16 691.84 1.97 684.19 1.97 L 15.81 1.97 C 8.16 1.97 1.97 8.16 1.97 15.81 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 83.52)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:41.27em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.61" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="571.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
