</div>
<div id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.1" class="ltx_p">In Equation <a href="#Ax20.E7" title="In MSGD-RL Optimizer ‣ Case Study ‣ Appendix C Implementation Details ‣ PromptFlow: Training Prompts Like Neural Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>, <math id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> is prompt result at step <math id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q(s_{t},a_{t})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q(s_{t},a_{t})</annotation></semantics></math> is the reward value at step <math id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, which uses <math id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> to rewrite prompt section <math id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{t}</annotation></semantics></math>. <math id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math> are hyper-parameters, which are defined as 0.5 here. The reward <math id="Ax20.SSx1.SSSx1.p7.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{t+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math> is obtained by calculating the average of the actions in the above sample.</p>
</div>
